  "report_markdown": "## Executive Summary\n\n- Bartłomiej Kasprzykowski played the titular Roman (Ray) in the Polish-language adaptation of Everybody Loves Raymond, titled Wszyscy kochają Romana. [10]\n- In the Polish adaptation Wszyscy kochają Romana, Bartłomiej Kasprzykowski is credited as Roman (Ray). [10]\n- Ray Romano played Raymond 'Ray' Barone on the CBS sitcom Everybody Loves Raymond (1996–2005). [2]\n- Everybody Loves Roman is a Polish-language TV series released September 2, 2011 in Poland. [3]\n- The Polish adaptation Wszyscy kochają Romana premiered on TVN on 2 September 2011. [10]\n\n## Findings\n\n### Finding 1: Original U.S. Series Casting\nRay Romano played Raymond 'Ray' Barone on the CBS sitcom *Everybody Loves Raymond* (1996–2005). This is confirmed by evidence directly stating the actor and role.\n\n### Finding 2: Polish Adaptation Title\nThe Polish-language version of *Everybody Loves Raymond* is titled *Wszyscy kochają Romana*, not *Wszyscy kochają Raymonda*. The claim that the title was *Wszyscy kochają Raymonda* is contradicted by evidence indicating the adaptation is titled *Wszyscy kochają Romana* (as referenced by the titular Roman).\n\n### Finding 3: Polish Adaptation Casting\nBartłomiej Kasprzykowski played the titular Roman (Ray) in the Polish-language adaptation *Wszyscy kochają Romana*. He is credited as \"Roman (Ray)\" in the adaptation.\n\n### Finding 4: Polish Adaptation Premiere Date\nThe Polish adaptation *Wszyscy kochają Romana* premiered on TVN on 2 September 2011. The claim that the Polish-language version aired from 1996 to 2005 is contradicted; those dates apply to the original American series, not the Polish version.\n\n### Finding 5: Unsupported Identification Claim\nThe claim that the actor who played Ray in the Polish-language version was not identified in the provided excerpts is accepted as accurately reflecting the excerpts' lack of identification. However, this is superseded by the accepted claim naming Bartłomiej Kasprzykowski as the actor.\n\n### Finding 6: Unrelated Polish Series\nMagda M. is a Polish television series whose main roles were played by Joanna Brodzik and Paweł Małaszyński. [16] This is unrelated to the *Everybody Loves Raymond* adaptations but is confirmed by evidence.\n\n## Evidence Status\n\n- **Accepted claims:** Ray Romano's role in the original series; the Polish adaptation title *Wszyscy kochają Romana*; Bartłomiej Kasprzykowski's role as Roman (Ray); the premiere date of 2 September 2011 on TVN; the lack of identification in the excerpts; and the casting of *Magda M.*\n- **Contradicted claims:** The Polish title *Wszyscy kochają Raymonda* (contradicted by evidence of *Wszyscy kochają Romana*); the Polish version airing from 1996 to 2005 (contradicted by the 2011 premiere date).\n- **No unsupported claims** were included in the final report; all claims are either accepted or contradicted per critic decisions.\n\n## References\n\n1. Polish Version Everybody Loves Raymond Actor Played Ray — https://www.instagram.com/popular/polish-version-everybody-loves-raymond-actor-played-ray (document: web_search-bb20d795481f8ea0)\n2. Ray Romano - Wikipedia — https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ray_Romano (document: web_search-9b2a2ccc79655a17)\n3. Everybody Loves Roman (TV Series 2011–2012) - IMDb — https://m.imdb.com/title/tt2255669 (document: web_search-50917566e953a8c1)\n4. 'Everybody Loves Raymond': See the Cast of the Hilarious Sitcom Today — https://www.yahoo.com/lifestyle/everybody-loves-raymond-see-cast-131109523.html (document: web_search-68003d17fa1a7a1a)\n5. Magda M. (TV Series 2005) — The Movie Database (TMDB) — https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/12949-magda-m?language=en-US (document: web_search-efb97c80df8d8e62)\n6. Magda M. (2005) Full Cast & Crew - Plex — https://watch.plex.tv/show/magda-m/credits (document: web_search-a326eb81c0a4edd3)\n7. Magda M. | TVmaze — https://www.tvmaze.com/shows/5863/magda-m (document: web_search-3c6939a150d0c556)\n8. Magda M. - Wikipedia — https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Magda_M. (document: web_search-19922bb6c5326266)\n9. Polish Version Everybody Loves Raymond Actor Played Ray — https://www.instagram.com/popular/polish-version-everybody-loves-raymond-actor-played-ray (document: web_search-0aa7b37378683b8b)\n10. Wszyscy kochają Romana - Wikipedia — https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Wszyscy_kochaj%C4%85_Romana (document: web_search-d7e34fe97355ed15)\n11. Everybody Loves Raymond — https://dubdb.fandom.com/wiki/Everybody_Loves_Raymond (document: web_search-f9c815e686c941ce)\n12. Wszyscy kochają Raymonda – Wikipedia, wolna encyklopedia — https://pl.wikipedia.org/wiki/Wszyscy_kochaj%C4%85_Raymonda (document: web_search-6ff7962a69c22328)\n13. Wszyscy kochają Raymonda 4 — https://programtv.onet.pl/serial/wszyscy-kochaja-raymonda-2842 (document: web_search-e162e45fcd0cc1ed)\n14. „Wszyscy kochają Raymonda” – rodzinne kłopoty podane inaczej niż zwykle — https://naekranie.pl/artykuly/wszyscy-kochaja-raymonda-rodzinne-klopoty-podane-inaczej-niz-zwykle (document: web_search-7228aa5fa0f80d11)\n15. Wszyscy kochają Raymonda (Serial TV 1996-2005) - Filmweb — https://www.filmweb.pl/serial/Wszyscy+kochaj%C4%85+Raymonda-1996-120824 (document: web_search-1418a5577d9fe8d8)\n16. Magda M. – Wikipedia, wolna encyklopedia — https://pl.wikipedia.org/wiki/Magda_M. (document: web_search-82c43f65c1f0799a)\n\n## Claim Register\n\n- (accepted, critical=false) Ray Romano played Raymond 'Ray' Barone on the CBS sitcom Everybody Loves Raymond (1996–2005). [2]\n- (accepted, critical=false) Everybody Loves Roman is a Polish-language TV series released September 2, 2011 in Poland. [3]\n- (accepted, critical=true) Bartłomiej Kasprzykowski played the titular Roman (Ray) in the Polish-language adaptation of Everybody Loves Raymond, titled Wszyscy kochają Romana. [10]\n- (accepted, critical=true) In the Polish adaptation Wszyscy kochają Romana, Bartłomiej Kasprzykowski is credited as Roman (Ray). [10]\n- (accepted, critical=false) The Polish adaptation Wszyscy kochają Romana premiered on TVN on 2 September 2011. [10]\n- (accepted, critical=false) Ray Barone in Everybody Loves Raymond is played by Ray Romano. [13]\n- (accepted, critical=false) Magda M. is a Polish television series whose main roles were played by Joanna Brodzik and Paweł Małaszyński. [16]\n",
